{
  "$comment": [
    "The append-only record of the firmware's value and action catalogue (project rule I2).",
    "APPEND ONLY. Nothing here is ever edited, reordered or removed by hand. A changed line is a",
    "rename or a repurpose and a missing line is a removal, and both break every menu pack that",
    "binds the id -- silently, because the id still resolves, to something else.",
    "Maintained by tools/catalogue/check-ledger.mjs --write, which is also the gate. That file",
    "explains what is pinned and, just as importantly, what is not: description, min/max/step and",
    "register are deliberately absent, because a gate that fails on a reworded sentence gets bypassed.",
    "sinceAbi is the catalogue ABI at which the id first appeared. Every id present on 2026-08-21 is",
    "recorded at 1 -- the ABI they were authored under. Back-dating them across the WiFi/MQTT and N-c",
    "rounds was rejected: no pack has ever been stamped with anything but 1, so those numbers would be",
    "invented history. From here, every addition bumps the ABI (owner's decision, 2026-08-21)."
  ],
